.nh
.TH "GTREE" "1" "Sep 2026" "gtree dev" "gtree Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
gtree-completion-powershell - Generate the autocompletion script for powershell


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBgtree completion powershell [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Generate the autocompletion script for powershell.

.PP
To load completions in your current shell session:

.EX
gtree completion powershell | Out-String | Invoke-Expression

.EE

.PP
To load completions for every new session, add the output of the above command
to your powershell profile.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for powershell

.PP
\fB--no-descriptions\fP[=false]
	disable completion descriptions


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP=""
	config file (default ~/.config/gtree/config.yml)

.PP
\fB-d\fP, \fB--depth\fP=0
	maximum recursion depth (0 = unlimited)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	disable color output

.PP
\fB--only-dirty\fP[=false]
	hide clean repositories

.PP
\fB-s\fP, \fB--sort\fP=""
	sort order: dirty|recent|name (default from config)

.PP
\fB--watch\fP[=false]
	live-refreshing view (polls every few seconds)


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBgtree-completion(1)\fP
